id":2455439453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SWwhd","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T18:38:36Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T18:38:36Z","body":"@patwork Could you create a screen capture of your logic? Or add multiple screenshots to your PR?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455439453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455630530","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98749#issuecomment-2455630530","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98749","id":2455630530,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SXfLC","user":{"login":"patwork","id":224215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDIxNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork","html_url":"https://github.com/patwork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T20:23:52Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T20:23:52Z","body":"> @patwork Could you create a screen capture of your logic? Or add multiple screenshots to your PR?\r\n\r\nSure. The changes mainly relate to the relationship between `Background` and `Ambient Light`, the rest is pretty much the same as before, just arranged a little differently inside the function.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455630530/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455748182","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98749#issuecomment-2455748182","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98749","id":2455748182,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SX75W","user":{"login":"patwork","id":224215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDIxNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork","html_url":"https://github.com/patwork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-04T21:34:31Z","updated_at":"2024-11-04T22:01:29Z","body":"### `Before` (v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]) and `After` (v4.4.dev.custom_build [c6c464cf9] + PR) screenshots\r\n\r\n001 - when `Background` is `Clear Color` and `Ambient Light` is `Background` there is no need for `Color` and `Energy` in `Ambient Light` (they are not working)\r\n\r\n![001](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6fe1f08d-1a26-4e83-a739-60965526a56a)\r\n\r\n002 - like in 001, no need for `Color` and `Energy` in `Ambient Light`\r\n\r\n![002](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28c39eab-7d7a-4bd9-af6b-b1bc9465d9b3)\r\n\r\n003 -  when `Background` is `Sky` and `Ambient Light` is `Background`, controls `Color`, `Sky Contribution` and `Energy` are visible like before\r\n\r\n![003](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea56af22-5a84-45e9-8e2f-a40474f3dd0b)\r\n\r\n004 - `Canvas` in `Background` shows `Canvas Max Layer`, but `Color` and `Energy` in `Ambient Light` are not needed\r\n\r\n![004](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0e1e0aa4-bb57-4746-9c51-068bb51b0723)\r\n\r\n005 - like in 004, `Keep` in `Background` means `Color` and `Energy` in `Ambient Light` are not needed (I guess `Energy Multiplier` in `Background` could be hidden as well?)\r\n\r\n![005](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a39c75d1-7fc8-4eb4-a3fd-c16ecf60a75a)\r\n\r\n006 - `Camera Feed` in `Background` shows `Camera Feed ID`, but like in 004 and 005 `Color` and `Energy` in `Ambient Light` are not needed\r\n\r\n![006](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f6268f0-48d1-4377-805d-b6af3c749ba7)\r\n\r\n007 - when `Ambient Light` is `Color` there is no need to show another (non functional) `Color` in `Background`\r\n\r\n![007](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d2d638f-dde8-4dc9-bf47-1bd1dd8ae9bf)\r\n\r\nMy main idea was to hide the controls that do not work in the specific `Background` and `Ambient Light` configurations.\r\n\r\nFor example, the default setting of `Background` to `Clear Color` and `Ambient Light` to `Background`, in 4.3 displayed the `Color` and `Energy` controls in `Ambient Light`, which had no effect on the lighting. It was only when changing `Background` to `Sky` that it additionally displayed `Sky Contribution`, which when reduced to less than 1.0 caused `Color` and `Energy` to take effect.\r\n\r\nLeaving `Background` on `Clear Color` but switching `Ambient Light` to `Color` caused the `Color` and `Energy` controls to start interacting with the lighting, but as you can see in example 007 there was then an additional `Color` in `Background` which made no sense (it only works in `Custom Color` mode).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2455748182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457877964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98749#issuecomment-2457877964","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98749","id":2457877964,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SgD3M","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T18:23:31Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T18:23:31Z","body":"Are the values kept even if they are hidden? Like does the color set in \"custom color\" is still saved on \"clear color\" mode?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457877964/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457914348","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98749#issuecomment-2457914348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98749","id":2457914348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SgMvs","user":{"login":"patwork","id":224215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDIxNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork","html_url":"https://github.com/patwork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-05T18:44:31Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T18:44:31Z","body":"Yes, all variables are stored in the resource all the time. Note that I did not create a function that hides specific controls (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b00e1cbf743dcb6a2b7f6bd14e348a1a7cf3d403/scene/resources/environment.cpp#L1092C1-L1189C2), I only improved the existing behavior depending on the configuration of the selected options. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2457914348/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2662313761","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98749#issuecomment-2662313761","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98749","id":2662313761,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6er68h","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-17T07:54:52Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T07:54:52Z","body":"Just looking at some backlog, this looks like a nice improvement. It be nice if it could be rebased.\r\n\r\nThe OP is correct that certain settings only work if certain selections are made, so hiding settings that do not apply makes sense and prevents confusion.\r\n\r\nI've always drawn the line with hiding settings that do not work on certain renderers, because projects may be exported to different platforms that use different renderers. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2662313761/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4034438177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98749#issuecomment-4034438177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98749","id":4034438177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7weKQh","user":{"login":"patwork","id":224215,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDIxNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork","html_url":"https://github.com/patwork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/patwork/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-10T21:00:26Z","updated_at":"2026-03-10T21:00:26Z","body":"@Nintorch thanks for digging up this PR, but after all this time it must be totally rewritten to match current state of the engine before it could be reviewed by the team. Especially after recent merge of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116662. I can do it, if you're interested in merging it in the near future.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4034438177/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]